     '["Lie on a flat bench holding dumbbells above your chest with slightly bent elbows.","Lower your arms out to both sides in a wide arc until you feel a stretch.","Bring the dumbbells back together using your chest muscles."]'::jsonb,
     'The Unlicense (Public Domain) - yuhonas/free-exercise-db'),
    (NULL, 'free-exercise-db', 'Pushups', 'Flexão de Braços', 'Pushups',
